          },
          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The Data Steward sought legal advice from the Privacy Team regarding the sharing of interview transcripts. While the participants expressed a desire to contribute to Open Science by sharing their data, privacy concerns presented a challenge. To reconcile these interests, the participants were classified as data authors rather than data subjects. This approach allows for data sharing without compromising privacy. However, it's important to note that the institution, as the data owner, bears sole responsibility for data curation and archival."
          },
